---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
---

<section class="two-paths">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="visually-hidden">Size uygun hizmeti seçin</h2>
    <div class="two-paths__grid">
      <a class="two-paths__card" href="/kentsel-donusum">
        <span class="two-paths__label">Kentsel Dönüşüm</span>
        <h3>Binanız riskli mi çıktı?<br />Arsanız mı var?</h3>
        <p>Riskli yapı sürecinden anahtar teslime kadar kentsel dönüşümde yanınızdayız.</p>
        <span class="two-paths__link">Kentsel dönüşüm süreci <Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></span>
      </a>

      <a class="two-paths__card two-paths__card--dark" href="/hizmetler/alt-muteahhitlik">
        <span class="two-paths__label">Müteahhitlik</span>
        <h3>Ana yüklenici misiniz?<br />Taşeron mu arıyorsunuz?</h3>
        <p>Alt müteahhitlikten anahtar teslim projelere, kurumsal iş ortaklığı için buradayız.</p>
        <span class="two-paths__link">Müteahhitlik hizmetlerimiz <Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .two-paths {
    padding-block: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .two-paths__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-m);
  }

  .two-paths__card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-s);
    padding: var(--space-l);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--color-bg-light);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    transition:
      transform var(--transition),
      box-shadow var(--transition);
  }

  .two-paths__card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .two-paths__card--dark {
    background: var(--color-navy-deep);
    border-color: var(--color-navy-deep);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .two-paths__card--dark p {
    color: var(--color-on-dark-muted);
  }

  .two-paths__label {
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }

  .two-paths__card--dark .two-paths__label {
    color: #9fa3e8;
  }

  .two-paths__card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .two-paths__card p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 42ch;
  }

  .two-paths__link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: var(--space-s);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .two-paths__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
